  "payload": {
    "subject": "#004 Round 2: getWebAppMenu改造 + mainmenu适配 + checkPermissions移植 + initMenu适配",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 背景\n\nRound 1 已交付：Token桥接API、菜单代理API、CORS、hrm-proxy代理页、postMessage监听全部就绪。\n\nRound 2 目标：让鸿冠前端通过菜单代理 API 获取动态菜单（含 HRM 模块 + 鸿冠模块），并支持按钮权限检查。\n\n## 涉及文件\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|------|------|\n| `wwwroot/js/baseService.js` | getWebAppMenu 改调 API + 降级 |\n| `wwwroot/js/appContext.js` | 添加 checkPermissions / checkTabPermissions |\n| `wwwroot/libs/mainmenu/index.js` | openMenu 传 menuButtons + 图标适配 |\n| `wwwroot/js/app.js` | initMenu startup 适配 title/name |\n\n所有文件在鸿冠前端项目：`D:\\work\\cc\\caikuangzi01.huoguan_erp\\trunk\\IChainStar.Infrastructure.Frontend\\`\n\n## Task 5a: getWebAppMenu 改调菜单代理 API\n\n**文件**: `wwwroot/js/baseService.js`\n\n当前从静态 `menu.json` 读取，改为调用 `/api/menu-proxy/get-list-by-role`：\n\n```javascript\nasync getWebAppMenu() {\n    return Http.invoke(\"/api/menu-proxy/get-list-by-role\", \"POST\", {\n        platformId: window.PlatformId,\n    }).then((data) => {\n        console.log(data);\n        let { children, startup } = data;\n        let menu = {\n            id: \"0\",\n            title: \"Web端\",\n            parentId: \"0\",\n            children,\n            startup,\n        };\n        return menu;\n    }).catch(function(err) {\n        console.warn(\"动态菜单加载失败，回退到静态 menu.json\", err);\n        return Http.get(\"menu.json\", {\n            platformId: window.PlatformId,\n        }).then((data) => {\n            let { children, startup } = data;\n            return {\n                id: \"0\", title: \"Web端\", parentId: \"0\",\n                children, startup,\n            };\n        });\n    });\n},\n```\n\n**关键点**：\n- `Http.invoke` 返回的是 `res.data`，即 `{children, startup}`，所以 `let { children, startup } = data` 正确\n- 降级策略：API 失败时回退到静态 menu.json\n\n## Task 5b: mainmenu 字段适配\n\n**文件**: `wwwroot/libs/mainmenu/index.js`\n\n### 5b.1 openMenu 传 menuButtons\n\n找到 `openMenu(menu)` 方法，在 `addRoute` 调用时加上 `menuButtons`：\n\n```javascript\nvar route = this.appContext.route.addRoute({\n    id: menu.id,\n    path: menu.path,\n    name: menu.title,\n    menuButtons: menu.menuButtons || [],\n});\n```\n\n### 5b.2 图标适配\n\n菜单代理返回的图标名可能包含分路风格（如 `icon-people`）。检查 mainmenu 的图标渲染：\n\n```javascript\n<icon :name=\"Lv1.icon?.replace('fa fa-','')\" family=\"fa4\"></icon>\n```\n\n如果 `icon-people` 不显示，在图标渲染处加兼容逻辑（如 `replace('icon-', '')` 或映射表）。\n\n## Task 5c: checkPermissions 移植\n\n**文件**: `wwwroot/js/appContext.js`\n\n在 `route` 对象的 `removeCurrentRoute` 之后添加两个方法：\n\n```javascript\ncheckPermissions(btn) {\n    var index = this.items.findIndex(function(item) {\n        return item.id === this.currentRoute;\n    }.bind(this));\n    if (index >= 0) {\n        if (this.items[index].menuButtons && this.items[index].menuButtons.length > 0) {\n            return this.items[index].menuButtons.indexOf(btn) >= 0;\n        }\n    }\n    return false;\n},\n\ncheckTabPermissions(path, btn) {\n    if (path) {\n        var checkTabPermissionsFromSubMenu = function(menus, path, btn) {\n            for (var i = 0; i < menus.length; i++) {\n                if (menus[i].path === path) {\n                    if (menus[i].menuButtons && menus[i].menuButtons.length > 0) {\n                        if (menus[i].menuButtons.indexOf(btn) >= 0) {\n                            return true;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                if (menus[i].children && menus[i].children.length > 0) {\n                    var result = checkTabPermissionsFromSubMenu(menus[i].children, path, btn);\n                    if (result) return true;\n                }\n            }\n            return false;\n        };\n        return checkTabPermissionsFromSubMenu(this.appContext.menu.items, path, btn);\n    } else {\n        var index = this.items.findIndex(function(item) {\n            return item.id === this.currentRoute;\n        }.bind(this));\n        if (index >= 0) {\n            if (this.items[index].menuButtons && this.items[index].menuButtons.length > 0) {\n                return this.items[index].menuButtons.indexOf(btn) >= 0;\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n},\n```\n\n同时确保 `addRoute` 保留 `menuButtons` 字段：\n\n```javascript\nvar newRoute = {\n    id: route.id ?? Date.now() + Math.random(),\n    name: route.name || route.title,\n    path: route.path,\n    menuButtons: route.menuButtons || [],\n    // ...\n};\n```\n\n**暴露到全局**（在 app.js 或 appContext.js 末尾）：\n\n```javascript\nwindow.checkTabPermissions = function(path, btn) {\n    return appContext.route.checkTabPermissions(path, btn);\n};\n```\n\n## Task 8: initMenu startup 适配\n\n**文件**: `wwwroot/js/app.js`\n\n当前 `initMenu` 的解构可能不兼容菜单代理返回的字段（`title` vs `name`）。改为兼容写法：\n\n```javascript\nthis.initMenu().then(menu => {\n    var startup = menu.startup || {};\n    var parentId = startup.parentId || 0;\n    var id = startup.id;\n    var name = startup.title || startup.name || '首页';\n    var path = startup.path || 'views/dashbord/index.html';\n\n    if (id) {\n        this.appContext.menu.openKeys = [parentId, id];\n    }\n    var startupRoute = { id: id || 1, name: name, path: path };\n    var route = this.appContext.route.addRoute(startupRoute);\n    this.appContext.route.setCurrentRoute(route.id);\n});\n```\n\n## 验证要求\n\n1. 启动鸿冠前端，菜单应从 API 动态加载（检查 Network 面板有 `/api/menu-proxy/get-list-by-role` 请求）\n2. 菜单树正常渲染（含 HRM 模块 + 鸿冠模块）\n3. 图标正常显示\n4. 点击菜单节点，标签页正常打开\n5. Console 执行 `appContext.route.checkTabPermissions('views/xxx/index.html', 'add')` 返回正确结果\n6. 菜单 API 不可用时，降级到静态 menu.json（停止后端验证）\n\n## 参考\n\n- 实施计划：`AgentTeams/shared/requirements/004-plan-HRM集成到鸿冠ERP-阶段1.md`\n- 契约 B（菜单代理 API 响应格式）\n- 契约 E（postMessage 协议，Round 1 已实现）",
